 "name_en": "Advanced Bank Statement Automation (4X8)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Advanced Bank Statement Automation (4X8)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Advanced Bank Statement Automation creates templates for reprocessing rules by learning from past patterns of the manual actions taken during the reprocessing of the bank statement items. Instead of only being able to create reprocessing rules manually, you can use the templates to create reprocessing rules more easily.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Moreover, with the scope item activated, the reprocessing of bank statement items is triggered automatically following the initial posting. Thus, the system applies the corresponding reprocessing rules to the pending items to complete the postings.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reprocess bank statement based on the automated reprocessing rules</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Propose the reprocessing rules based on the past manual reprocessing actions</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Save effort in this labor-intensive process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Consume the fully integrated business process easily</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>高级银行对账单自动化 (4X8)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">高级银行对账单自动化通过了解重新处理银行对账单项目期间采取的手动操作的过去模式，创建重新处理规则的模板。您可以使用模板更轻松地创建重新处理规则，而不是只能手动创建重新处理规则。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此外，激活范围项目 后，将在初始过账后自动触发银行对账单项目的重新处理。因此，系统会将相应的重新处理规则应用于待定项目以完成过账。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据自动重新处理规则重新处理银行对账单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据过去的手动重新处理操作，建议重新处理规则</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio489087f98abc49e99d1d0e953800c5b2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">节省劳动密集型流程中的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松使用完全集成的业务流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
